・もしも可能であれば、1枚目に少年が黒ギャルを注意する前振りシーンがあると嬉しいです。(タナトスの乳房11月号の、授業参観シーンのような前振り)\n\n\nご多忙の中で細かい希望が多く恐縮ですが、可能な範囲で何卒ご一考いただけますと幸いです。 よろしくお願いいたします……！", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yutora_tekui123/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9a6a49cd/uploads/origins/214662b7-5169-4861-87ac-8865f64439e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7f5102d79784ccd988dbc8d88a9c4023", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9a6a49cd/uploads/origins/214662b7-5169-4861-87ac-8865f64439e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7f5102d79784ccd988dbc8d88a9c4023, https://si.imgix.net/9a6a49cd/uploads/origins/214662b7-5169-4861-87ac-8865f64439e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0253bb810a75243f3a8f3b2eeb43f773 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9a6a49cd/uploads/origins/214662b7-5169-4861-87ac-8865f64439e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9de3cb41dfc30bf0a2eb9521e8cecea2 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2526105, "client_id": 415749, "nc": 49}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 6678, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "伊吹のつ", "screen_name": "sai_no", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F503f0b18-7d07-447d-9aec-95e15da397db.png%3Fsensitive%3Dtrue&avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/f733baf3-3577-4aa8-9f82-8